s and Practices Commission\nThe Professional Standards and Practices Commission sets preparation, certification, practice, and conduct standards for teachers.\nState Board of Education\nThe State Board of Education reviews, develops, and adopts regulations that govern basic and higher education in the Commonwealth.\nState Board of Higher Education\nProvide direction, coordination, and support to ensure that institutions of higher education fully meet the workforce and economic development needs of this Commonwealth.\n	Campus Safety	state	t	\N	\N	2025-05-15 17:32:04.827	2025-03-12 19:08:11.737	\N	\N	\N	https://www.education.pa.gov/Postsecondary-Adult/Pages/default.aspx	paHigherEd	\N	paHigherEd	https://www.education.pa.gov/agencies/education.html	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	[{"url": "https://www.education.pa.gov/agencies/education.html", "type": "web-scrape", "lastChecked": "2025-03-12T19:08:11.737Z"}]	5	4842	2025-03-12 17:49:55.576564	\N	t	\N	PA	paHigherEd	[{"type": "attestation", "status": "completed", "enabled": true, "required": true, "completedAt": "2025-05-15T17:27:49.257Z", "completedBy": {"userId": 6, "fullName": "David Brandes", "username": "dvdbrnds"}, "completedDate": "2025-05-15T17:27:49.257Z"}, {"type": "website_publish", "status": "pending", "enabled": true, "required": true}, {"type": "community_communication", "status": "pending", "enabled": true, "required": true}, {"type": "agency_submission", "status": "pending", "enabled": true, "required": false}]		\N	\N
